OL,3,GNEWSAMusic group fulfills late MP's
OL,4,ABroadway dream
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe project's founder David Stanley
OL,7,Fsaid: "Following his death, I just made
OL,8,Fit my mission to fulfil that promise,
OL,9,Freally, in his memory."
